# Working notes live in the umbrella `Notes/` repo, which is private.
# `notes` here is a symlink to ../Notes/FerroLoop and must stay untracked.
# ⚠ NO TRAILING SLASH. Git reads `notes/` as "directory only", and a symlink is not a
# directory, so `notes/` would silently fail to ignore it and the link would be committed.
/notes
